Package: deduper
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Bence Mark Lukacs <43961338+xlukacs@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/xlukacs/Deduper
Description: interactive duplicate finder and folder cleanup tool
 Deduper recursively scans a directory, hashes candidate files with SHA-256,
 collapses hard-linked paths, and reports duplicate files and reclaimable space.
 Its terminal interface also finds configured folders and removes them after
 confirmation. A plain-text duplicate scan mode is available as well.
